[statement]
A symbolic link whose header declares a size of 2^60 - 1 in base-256, the
largest bsdtar reads past. Every reader reads the link with no data and the
member after it. Strict refuses a size on a symbolic link, as for any;
Compatible reads it.

[archive]
header name=t
data "x"
header name=l typeflag=2 linkname=t size=base256:1152921504606846975
header name=after
data "y"
end

[verdict]
strict: refused SizeWithoutData at 1024
compatible: read

